id: pm-vcs-move-probe-baseline
title: Investigate intermittent missing baseline syscall in packed staging probes
description: Round BR local quick shard 8 on Node 22.23.4 and Bun 1.3.5 reached the packed JSON staging fixture and installed the archive offline. The Bun-hosted fixture then reported zero matching syscall lines for the baseline scope/p0 probe before checking the command under test. The separate Node 26 run also flagged the TOON staging case after its Node consumer passed. A focused Node 26 retry with the workflow-pinned Bun 1.3.14 passed the TOON case in both runtimes. Capture trace diagnostics and distinguish runtime or host effects from fixture behavior while retaining the probe-budget assertions.
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
